{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 5, :comments ["<b>נאקת</b> — with alef-bet of Atbash: טתד\"א. In gematria: the Patriarchs. To teach you that the outcry of the Patriarchs and their prayer ascended."], :book :exodus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 6, :notes {0 "The phrase 'בגימ׳ האבות' (in gematria: the Patriarchs) likely means that the gematria of נאקת, when subjected to the Atbash substitution yielding טתד\"א, equals a value associated with the Patriarchs, though no specific number is given in the text."}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:12:03.766269440Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}